msgid "屏蔽互动：停止这对复制人的 Mod 社交事件和新增对话，不会直接分手或删除已有关系；原版互动仍可发生。"
msgstr "Block interactions: stop this pair’s mod social events and added dialogue. This does not break them up or delete their relationship; base-game interactions can still occur."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.MARK_MATCH
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.MARK_MATCH"
msgid "牵线：聊天好感 +{0}、告白成功率 +{1} 个百分点、道歉成功率 +{2} 个百分点、争执概率 ×{3}；挚友谈心机会与 Mod 新增对话频率翻倍。不会改写气场，也不保证恋爱成功。有伴侣时，与其他心动对象互动可能引发嫉妒。"
msgstr "Matchmaking: chat affinity +{0}, confession chance +{1} percentage points, apology chance +{2} percentage points, argument chance ×{3}; heart-to-hearts and mod-added dialogue occur twice as often. Chemistry stays the same; romance is not guaranteed. Interacting with another crush while partnered may trigger jealousy."

