msgstr "\nRecent events:"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.RIVAL_FROZEN
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.RIVAL_FROZEN"
msgid "宿敌·冻结中：负好感不会随时间回零，这段关系不会自行修复。用牵线标记介入可以解冻，让好感慢慢回暖"
msgstr "Rivals - frozen: negative affinity no longer drifts back toward zero, so this relationship will not heal on its own. Set a matchmaking mark to step in and thaw it."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.RIVAL_THAWING
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TOOLTIP.RIVAL_THAWING"
msgid "宿敌·调解中：牵线标记已解冻衰减，好感正在回暖；回到门槛之上就会解除宿敌"
msgstr "Rivals - mediating: the matchmaking mark has thawed the freeze and affinity is recovering. The rivalry ends once it climbs back past the threshold."

