#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STATE_SUMMARY
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STATE_SUMMARY"
msgid "恋人 {0} 对 · 冷战 {1} 对 · 挚友 {2} 对"
msgstr "Couples: {0} · Cold wars: {1} · Best friends: {2}"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_CLOSING_QUIET
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_CLOSING_QUIET"
msgid "这些平常时刻没有被大事记住，却共同构成了{0}在殖民地里的生活。"
msgstr "No milestone recorded these ordinary moments, but together they became {0}'s life in the colony."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_CLOSING_TURNING
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_CLOSING_TURNING"
msgid "经历过“{0}”以后，{1}带着它留下的影响走进了下一段生活。"
msgstr "After {0}, {1} carried its effects into the next part of life."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_LEAD_QUIET
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_LEAD_QUIET"
msgid "周期{1}至{2}，{0}在工作、吃饭与休息之间，慢慢和身边的人建立起自己的生活。"
msgstr "From cycle {1} to {2}, {0} built a life among the people nearby, between work, meals and rest."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_LEAD_TURNING
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_LEAD_TURNING"
msgid "从周期{1}起，{0}的日常一点点累积；到了周期{2}，{3}让这一段生活有了转折。"
msgstr "From cycle {1}, {0}'s ordinary days slowly accumulated; by cycle {2}, {3} gave this part of life a turning point."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_RANGE
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_RANGE"
msgid "周期{0}—{1}"
msgstr "Cycles {0}–{1}"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_CHAPTER_TITLE
