msgstr "[Involved]"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_READING_INTRO
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.STORY_READING_INTRO"
msgid "精选能代表人生阶段的经历，不是完整流水账；旁观或被卷入的重要事件也会收入。"
msgstr "Selected experiences that define each life chapter, not a complete log. Important events witnessed or indirectly involved in are included."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.MANAGEMENT.TELEMETRY_DISABLED
