msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_COOLDOWN"
msgid "原生聊天进入模组关系反馈的冷却（秒）"
msgstr "Cooldown for ONI chatter entering Mod relationship feedback (seconds)"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_COOLDOWN_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_COOLDOWN_HINT"
msgid "只限制同一对重复触发模组关系反馈和后续故事。ONI 原生对话气泡始终照常显示。默认 15 秒；另受每对每周期上限限制。"
msgstr "Only limits repeated Mod relationship feedback and follow-up stories from the same pair. ONI's native dialogue bubbles always appear as usual. Default: 15 seconds; the per-pair cycle cap still applies."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_LIMIT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_LIMIT"
msgid "每对每周期原生聊天触发模组关系反馈的上限（次）"
msgstr "ONI chatter relationship-feedback cap per pair per cycle"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_LIMIT_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.CHAT_FEED_LIMIT_HINT"
msgid "默认 2 次。ONI 原生对话气泡始终照常显示；上限只会让这一对停止重复触发模组关系反馈和后续故事，下一周期重置。"
msgstr "Default: 2. ONI's native dialogue bubbles always appear as usual; the cap only stops repeated Mod relationship feedback and follow-up stories for that pair until the next cycle."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COLLECTIVE_WRATH
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COLLECTIVE_WRATH"
msgid "允许集体迁怒"
msgstr "Allow collective scapegoating"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COLLECTIVE_WRATH_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COLLECTIVE_WRATH_HINT"
msgid "殖民地出大事之后（有人死亡／多人崩溃／粮仓见底），全员会把帐算在人缘最差的那个人头上，无论是不是 TA 的错：好感一次性下跌，接着滑进被孤立状态——垫底三人对 TA 只跌不涨、其他人路过会闪厌恶、同桌的人提前离席。两道出口都是玩家的工具：第一幕把 TA 和一位高声望者牵线，那人会仗义执言；第二幕任何人来照顾／倾诉／共餐都算破局。没人管也不会永久卡死，时间会冲淡。需要同时打开总开关；「戏剧强度」设为「安静」时强制关闭"
msgstr "After something bad happens to the colony (a death, several breakdowns, an empty larder), everyone pins it on whoever is least liked, guilty or not: a one-off affinity drop, then a slide into being frozen out - the three who like them least stop warming up at all, others flash disgust in passing, and tablemates leave early. Both exits are your tools: in act one, pair them with a well-respected colleague and that person will speak up; in act two, anyone tending, venting or eating with them breaks it. Nothing gets stuck forever - time fades it. Needs the master switch too, and Drama intensity set to Quiet disables it outright."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COOLDOWN_MULT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.COOLDOWN_MULT"
msgid "原生对话冷却倍率"
msgstr "Native conversation cooldown multiplier"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_CONTENT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_CONTENT"
msgid "启用黑暗内容"
msgstr "Enable dark content"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_CONTENT_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_CONTENT_HINT"
msgid "总开关，默认关。打开后下面的黑暗事件才会生效——互殴、断粮相残，以及后续加入的人性考验事件。这些内容涉及复制人之间的暴力与死亡；不想要的话保持关闭即可，其余社交功能完全不受影响"
msgstr "Master switch, off by default. The dark events below only take effect once this is on - brawls, famine cannibalism, and the tests of character added later. This content involves violence and death between duplicants; leave it off if you would rather not have it, and every other social feature carries on unchanged."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_GATE_CLOSED
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.DARK_GATE_CLOSED"
